config MB_LAB_MMAP
	tristate "mmap lab: share a kernel page with userspace"
	default m
	help
	  A misc device whose .mmap remaps a kernel page into the calling
	  process with remap_pfn_range(). The user_mmap tool in the same
	  directory maps it, reads the kernel's message and writes one
	  back through the shared physical page.
